  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> be three vectors such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>15</mn></msqrt><mo>.</mo></math> If&nbsp;<math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to (here, the angle between <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is acute)"
  },
